OL,3,GNEWSAWhy has Peterborough's local plan
OL,4,Abeen called in?
OL,5,
OL,6,FA plan for 20,000 new homes and 196
OL,7,Fhectares (484 acres) of employment
OL,8,Fspace in a city could go back to the
OL,9,Fdrawing board.
OL,11,FPeterborough City Council is holding an
OL,12,Fextraordinary meeting on Tuesday
OL,13,Fevening on whether to review the final
OL,14,Fdraft of its local plan.
OL,16,FThe document has already been approved
OL,17,Fby the council's cabinet, but the
OL,18,Fdecision was later called in.
OL,20,FThis is what the call-in could mean for
OL,21,Fpeople in Peterborough.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
